#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "GYM Enthusiast Theme is designed with a structured layout suitable for fitness-focused websites. The theme includes sections for workout programs, trainers, schedules, membership plans, testimonials, and blog content. It supports responsive layouts that adapt across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices for consistent viewing. The homepage layout includes customizable banners, featured service sections, image galleries, and call-to-action areas. Built-in typography and color settings allow adjustments without modifying core files. The theme also supports navigation menus, widget-ready areas, and social media integration for easier content organization. Several template layouts are included for pages such as classes, trainer profiles, pricing details, and contact information. The design emphasizes clean spacing and organized content presentation while maintaining fast-loading structure and compatibility with standard plugins. Customization options are available through the theme settings panel, enabling changes to logos, headers, footer sections, colors, and layout arrangements. The theme also supports translation-ready functionality and basic SEO-friendly coding practices for improved content indexing and accessibility."
msgstr ""

